   4:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *
   5:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  * \details   Declares the CddSys function API used across the CDD layer for
   6:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *            TriCore-specific primitives:
   7:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *              - Atomic bit-field load-modify-store (LDMST instruction).
   8:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *              - Binary semaphore via compare-and-swap (CMPSWAP.W instruction).
   9:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *              - Single and multi-instruction NOP delays.
  10:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *              - Interrupt-enable intrinsic.
