 645:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c **** /**
 646:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  * \brief   Starts all enabled eGTM ATOM channels synchronously.
 647:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *
 648:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  * \details Sets HOST_TRIG in EGTM_CLS0_ATOM_AGC_GLB_CTRL, which latches the
 649:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *          shadow registers and starts every enabled channel at the same
 650:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *          eGTM clock edge. From this point the master channel drives the
 651:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *          control-loop ISR and the PWM phases drive the gate outputs.
 652:../complex_device_driver/cdd_egtm_app.c ****  *
